{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore the vast ocean, survive deadly encounters, and uncover the secrets of a lost island.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adrift in Silence</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.poster.avif?t=1760624676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.webm?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.mp4?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is calm. The sky burns orange. You\u2019re alone until the storm crashes down, and the nightmare begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isle of Lost Souls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/694784b2e7ce0595fa643741aa7c90dd.poster.avif?t=1760624676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/694784b2e7ce0595fa643741aa7c90dd.webm?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/694784b2e7ce0595fa643741aa7c90dd.mp4?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island cursed by science. Dinosaur souls roam the land, restless and powerful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Burning Wilderness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/a5b3b8f1c20bc90f4cbb66945e6d8a18.poster.avif?t=1760624676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/a5b3b8f1c20bc90f4cbb66945e6d8a18.webm?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/a5b3b8f1c20bc90f4cbb66945e6d8a18.mp4?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jungle ignites around you. Shadows roar through the flames. Nature itself has turned against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Island Wasn't Meant to Be Found</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4d5f4f54a02054c96eaf91a63d607e3d.poster.avif?t=1760624676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4d5f4f54a02054c96eaf91a63d607e3d.webm?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4d5f4f54a02054c96eaf91a63d607e3d.mp4?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged from the sea to a forgotten land, you wake in a place where nature never moved on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Past. Challenge the Future</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.poster.avif?t=1760624676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.webm?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.mp4?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark experiments that doomed this land and water. Encounter ancient creatures brought back to life by science and greed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-driven adventure where every moment is packed with tension and spectacle. From being stranded at sea to battling prehistoric predators, players are taken on a linear yet immersive journey across ocean and island environments. Explore a mysterious sci-fi lab, witness dramatic dinosaur encounters, and make it through high-stakes sequences with limited combat and intense pacing. Your goal: uncover the truth and escape alive.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Still Waters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736540/da6a3c9e557da8b96f6ed116fd575f421e168df3.jpg"},{"name":"Below the Surface","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736540/d70a95319e1679a227d9746dd1c08dd07f763c11.jpg"},{"name":"Drowned Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736540/f7ffabacccc4a249dfc8fd746decc241ff071e39.jpg"},{"name":"Taken by the Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736540/bc447a381db8d9f62cad007fabf4506027036dca.jpg"},{"name":"Toxic Reflection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736540/2bb263e17d0b45a12a456d368c492c3087123d87.jpg"},{"name":"Living Experiment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736540/72a09d112c9f0fa158693df8a61af9a1929ec731.jpg"},{"name":"Memory of Silence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun