flames. Nature itself has turned against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Island Wasn't Meant to Be Found</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4d5f4f54a02054c96eaf91a63d607e3d.poster.avif?t=1760624676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4d5f4f54a02054c96eaf91a63d607e3d.webm?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4d5f4f54a02054c96eaf91a63d607e3d.mp4?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged from the sea to a forgotten land, you wake in a place where nature never moved on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Past. Challenge the Future</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.poster.avif?t=1760624676\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.webm?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.mp4?t=1760624676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark experiments that doomed this land and water. Encounter ancient creatures brought back to life by science and greed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-driven adventure where every moment is packed with tension and spectacle. From being stranded at sea t